    # Gradle only resolves a library for the source sets declaring it. The Android-only libraries (androidMain and
    # the Android tests) would otherwise raise versions on the JVM and native; the desktop-only ones, the compiler
    # plugins and the tools would pull the desktop Compose stack (skiko) into Android.
